OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FFive police officers who were injured
OL,8,Fin a boat crash in central London were
OL,9,Fresponding to a report of a "person in
OL,10,Fthe water", the Metropolitan Police
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FA boat from the force's marine
OL,14,Fpolicing unit carrying armed officers
OL,15,Fcrashed into Westminster Bridge on the
OL,16,FRiver Thames at around 3.40pm on
OL,17,FFriday.
OL,26,@qD@]OUrD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/11
