FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FOfficers were responding to a report
OL,8,Fof a person in the water near
OL,9,FBattersea when their boat hit the
OL,10,Fbridge, throwing three of them into
OL,11,Fthe water, the Met said.
OL,13,FBoats nearby rescued the officers and
OL,14,Fthey were treated at the scene before
OL,15,Fgoing to hospital, where four remain
OL,16,Fwith serious but non-life-threatening
OL,17,Finjuries.
OL,19,FOne officer has been discharged from
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FNo members of the public were injured
OL,8,Fin the incident, the force added.
OL,10,FMet Police Commander Nick John said:
OL,11,F"Our thoughts are with all those
OL,12,Finvolved, in particular our officers
OL,13,Fwho were injured and those who
OL,14,Fresponded in challenging circumstances.
OL,16,F"The four officers who remain in
OL,17,Fhospital have serious but non-life-
OL,18,Fthreatening injuries. We will give
OL,19,Fthem all every support as they recover.
OL,26,@sD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,F"I must also offer our thanks to those
OL,8,Friver users who came to the aid of the
OL,9,Fofficers, as well as other police and
OL,10,Femergency service colleagues who
OL,11,Fimmediately made their way to the
OL,12,Fscene to assist.
OL,14,F"The quick-thinking and
OL,15,Fprofessionalism of all those involved
OL,16,Fundoubtedly prevented any further
OL,17,Finjuries."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/11
