OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FA couple from the United States, who
OL,13,Fwere nearby when the crash happened,
OL,14,Fsaid they heard "an explosion" when
OL,15,Fthe boat struck the bridge, adding it
OL,16,Fwas travelling at "high speed",
OL,17,Fseemingly in pursuit of something
OL,18,Ffurther up the river.
OL,26,@vD@QOUvD@^O]xD@SOUxD@^O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/11
