OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FJim Bagley, who was visiting the
OL,8,Fcapital from Gloucester,
OL,9,FMassachusetts, with his wife, told the
OL,10,FPress Association: "We were standing
OL,11,Fin line to get onto the city cruise
OL,12,Fhop on, hop off tours, and we saw two
OL,13,Fpolice boats coming up the river.
OL,15,F"One was an orange boat that went
OL,16,Funder the bridge and left a great big
OL,17,Fwave, and then there was a black boat
OL,18,Fthat came up behind it, the police
OL,19,Fboat.
OL,26,@rD@TOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,F"It looks to me that he got stuck in
OL,8,Fthe wake of the other boat that had
OL,9,Fjust passed through the bridge and
OL,10,Fslammed into the wall on the opposite
OL,11,Fside.
OL,13,F"We didn't see it happen, but we heard
OL,14,Fthe explosion... the next thing we saw
OL,15,Fwas three people in the water, coming
OL,16,Fdown the river."
OL,18,FThe couple then saw other boats on the
OL,19,Friver attempt to save those stranded
OL,20,Fin the water, throwing a cargo net and
OL,21,Fa life ring into the water.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@PO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
