PN,37208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FMr Bagley said: "There was another
OL,8,Fboat that came up from the river that
OL,9,Fhad an open transom, and they were
OL,10,Fable to back into the people in the
OL,11,Fwater and drag them onto the back of
OL,12,Fthe boat."
OL,14,FHe added: "We were wondering why they
OL,15,Fwere under way at high speed to begin
OL,16,Fwith. We don't know why they were
OL,17,Fbeing called upriver."
OL,26,@oD@QOUtD@JO]vD@KOUyD@VO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,373,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FHis wife, Katherine, said: "They were
OL,8,Fboth in pursuit of something farther
OL,9,Fdown the river, but they never... the
OL,10,Fsecond boat never got to it because it
OL,11,Fcrashed into the bridge with a big
OL,12,Fbang."
OL,14,FA 19-year-old student, who is on
OL,15,Fholiday in London from Germany, told
OL,16,FPA the collision sounded like a "car
OL,17,Fcrash".
OL,26,@oD@\OUtD@FO]xD@aOUyD@FO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
