CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FEnno, who did not want to give his
OL,8,Flast name, said he was walking over
OL,9,Fthe nearby Hungerford Bridge when he
OL,10,Fheard a "crashing sound".
OL,12,FHe added: "A black boat had crashed
OL,13,Finto the side of the bridge by the
OL,14,Fpier. I think around five police
OL,15,Fofficers were in the water at the same
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,18,F"They looked hurt, but not that much."
OL,26,@rD@IOUrD@XO]tD@KOUzD@AOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/11
