CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F372A1784978317
OL,3,CFive officers hurt in police boat
OL,4,Ccrash were responding to 'person in
OL,5,Cwater'
OL,7,FHe added: "It sounded like a car crash
OL,8,Ffrom around 10 metres away. I had seen
OL,9,Fthe black boat pass under the bridge
OL,10,Fand once I heard the sound, I saw that
OL,11,Fit had crashed."
OL,26,@oD@KOUsD@PO]
